### hilavitkutin-str

Interned string primitives for the hilavitkutin ecosystem. `no_std`,
built on `hilavitkutin-sym` for the identity handle. The string handle
`Str` is one domain of that generic core. Provides the `Str` handle, the
`str_const!` macro for compile-time registration via linker sections, the
`ArenaInterner` trait for host-provided backends, and the `StringInterner`
wrapper (which is the first implementer of the sym-core `Interner` trait).
